---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — The Habit Monk">
  <section class="wrap page">
    <header class="page-head">
      <span class="meta">About</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">Why this exists.</h1>
      <hr class="rule" />
    </header>

    <div class="content prose-measure">
      <p>
        I'm curious about how we look at the things around us, and how that
        changes over time. We update our beliefs as we meet new information,
        often without noticing.
      </p>
      <p>
        This is my journal of those updates, seen through two lenses: the
        <em>work-self</em>, occupied with learning science, cognition and the
        tools that close the feedback loop; and the <em>citizen-self</em>,
        working through society, history, privilege and contemporary India.
        Some entries are long-form essays; some are one-liners from books I've
        read.
      </p>
      <p>
        Writing here pushes me to think and deliberate more about the
        interesting things I come across. I keep it in the open to stay honest,
        and so there's a dated record I can be held to. With AI threaded into
        our daily lives, it's easier than ever to mistake taking in information
        for thinking about it. Long-form writing is my way out of that illusion
        of active thinking, and a way to make myself a little harder to fool.
      </p>
      <p>
        The <a href="/society">Society</a> section is the heart of it: living
        positions that carry a status and a date, revised rather than erased. The
        <a href="/writing">Writing</a> is where those positions get worked out at
        length. <a href="/readings">Readings</a> and the
        <a href="/reading-list">Reading List</a> keep the inputs honest too.
      </p>
      <p class="sign">— Mahendra</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page { padding: 4rem 0 0; }
  .page-head { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .page-title { font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 44px); margin-top: 0.6rem; }
  .content { font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--ink); }
  .content p { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
  .content a { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
  .content em { color: var(--navy); font-style: italic; }
  .sign { font-family: var(--font-body); font-style: italic; color: var(--muted); }
</style>
